D-C2 recorded and NOT changed, per the brief: the sampling seed is per-(request, slot).

NOTE for whoever picks up D-C12: this attempt's fix retires the mesh program cache when a
model's global CB is released (faec6e59938). D-C12 is a warm-program-cache staleness
defect. The two are not the same thing - D-C12 is stale WITHIN one model's lifetime, where
no release happens - but they are adjacent, and the new release_galaxy_global_cb_placement
is a place to look.
